# --- art ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The art is CraftPix free content. Its licence covers using the assets in a
# game but not redistributing the files themselves, so the packs are not in the
# repository. Rebuild assets/ from your own downloads with:
#
#     .\tools\import_assets.ps1 -GameAssets "path\to\the\craftpix\zips"
#
assets/

# Both written by the importer from the optional equipment icon packs, so
# data/items.json never refers to art that may not be installed. Generated
# rather than authored, and meaningless without the packs, so neither is
# committed.
data/items_armour.json
data/loot_tables_armour.json

# --- local state -------------------------------------------------------------
saves/
settings.json
imgui.ini

